Timeout recovery integrates with:

- **§0 (AST Dependency Graph)**: ADG is PRIMARY tool for timeout analysis
- **§1 (Testing)**: Test collection/execution timeouts use ADG to isolate slow tests
- **§2 (Evidence)**: All recovery attempts documented in evidence
- **§3 (Scope)**: Isolated scope must have graph justification
- **§5 (CI Gates)**: CI validates timeout recovery patterns

